{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "01026",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 0.99,
      "end_seconds": 4.12,
      "duration_seconds": 3.13,
      "text": "Sorry, doctor, shall I sit here?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 5.68,
      "end_seconds": 9.34,
      "duration_seconds": 3.66,
      "text": "Of course, leave it there. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 11.06,
      "end_seconds": 24.1,
      "duration_seconds": 13.04,
      "text": "So the thing is, I've got being very thirsty. I took the morning off to come in today. I'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 25.87,
      "end_seconds": 29.77,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "How many days or weeks has it been?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 30.33,
      "end_seconds": 31.72,
      "duration_seconds": 1.39,
      "text": "Just since yesterday."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.95,
      "end_seconds": 39.47,
      "duration_seconds": 3.52,
      "text": "Rate it for me, mild, moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 40.5,
      "end_seconds": 42.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.27,
      "text": "I'd call it severe."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.52,
      "end_seconds": 47.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Does anything else come with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 49.33,
      "end_seconds": 87.99,
      "duration_seconds": 38.66,
      "text": "Vomiting goes along with it, most of the time. As for vomiting, I'd say moderate. It happens all the time. As for passing a lot of urine, I honestly can't say when that began. It might have been last month or the month before. About passing a lot of urine, I'd say moderate. I've also had tummy pain, for two days. About tummy pain, it's a couple of times a week."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 89.83,
      "end_seconds": 92.42,
      "duration_seconds": 2.59,
      "text": "Let me quickly check your readings."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 104.91,
      "end_seconds": 106.88,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Sit still for a moment..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 128.24,
      "end_seconds": 134.11,
      "duration_seconds": 5.87,
      "text": "Okay: pulse 123, temp 37.1 degrees, BP is 116 over 88."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.82,
      "end_seconds": 139.7,
      "duration_seconds": 3.88,
      "text": "Alright, over here please and I'll take a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 140.89,
      "end_seconds": 142.87,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "Raise your arm for me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.62,
      "end_seconds": 161.36,
      "duration_seconds": 4.74,
      "text": "You are dry, breathing deeply and your breath smells fruity."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 164.28,
      "end_seconds": 166.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.06,
      "text": "So, that's the examination finished."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.04,
      "end_seconds": 184.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.84,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any chest pain or cough?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 186.52,
      "end_seconds": 190.32,
      "duration_seconds": 3.8,
      "text": "No chest pain or cough, none of it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 191.47,
      "end_seconds": 193.96,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Any rashes or skin problems otherwise?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.75,
      "end_seconds": 198.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.42,
      "text": "Nothing on the skin, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.13,
      "end_seconds": 203.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.1,
      "text": "How are your joints, any aches elsewhere?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 203.76,
      "end_seconds": 205.23,
      "duration_seconds": 1.47,
      "text": "No, nothing there."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 206.42,
      "end_seconds": 208.4,
      "duration_seconds": 1.98,
      "text": "What about your medical history?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 209.44,
      "end_seconds": 219.41,
      "duration_seconds": 9.97,
      "text": "I, I have diabetes. I've had asthma, yes. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 220.22,
      "end_seconds": 227.17,
      "duration_seconds": 6.95,
      "text": "Yes, asthma is known to us, good to have that clear. Have you ever had an operation?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 228.45,
      "end_seconds": 233.66,
      "duration_seconds": 5.21,
      "text": "Yes, I had my septum straightened, in my thirties."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 242.5,
      "end_seconds": 245.54,
      "duration_seconds": 3.04,
      "text": "Before we go further, any allergies?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 247.42,
      "end_seconds": 250.87,
      "duration_seconds": 3.45,
      "text": "No, nothing as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 255.99,
      "end_seconds": 260.5,
      "duration_seconds": 4.51,
      "text": "Any inherited conditions that you know of in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 261.93,
      "end_seconds": 264.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.39,
      "text": "My uncle has high cholesterol."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 269.71,
      "end_seconds": 273.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.28,
      "text": "Can you list what you take, tablets, creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 274.61,
      "end_seconds": 290.2,
      "duration_seconds": 15.59,
      "text": "It's Asthalin inhaler, when needed. I'm supposed to take it regularly, but I don't always manage. I had glimepiride at one point, but I'm off it now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 295.3,
      "end_seconds": 297.95,
      "duration_seconds": 2.65,
      "text": "Now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.29,
      "end_seconds": 317.79,
      "duration_seconds": 15.5,
      "text": "I've never touched a cigarette. I'll have a glass of wine with dinner. I'm a plumber, lots of bending and kneeling. My husband and I live above the shop."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 319.42,
      "end_seconds": 326.42,
      "duration_seconds": 7.0,
      "text": "Having listened and examined, it points towards diabetic ketoacidosis. I'd also keep a severe infection in mind."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 327.86,
      "end_seconds": 330.63,
      "duration_seconds": 2.77,
      "text": "Do you think it's something serious?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 333.54,
      "end_seconds": 340.78,
      "duration_seconds": 7.24,
      "text": "It's reasonable to be concerned, but right now diabetic ketoacidosis is my leading thought, not anything worse."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 357.81,
      "end_seconds": 380.74,
      "duration_seconds": 22.93,
      "text": "I think blood gas and electrolytes makes sense here, for DKA. I'll request a blood sugar and ketone test, it'll help with thirst and vomiting. You need to go to hospital now for insulin and fluids. Let's get you seen by the emergency team, I'll arrange the letter. That's all from me. Any questions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 382.78,
      "end_seconds": 386.0,
      "duration_seconds": 3.22,
      "text": "Great, thank you for your help."
    }
  ]
}